  "notes": "Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), る-ending.\n- Negative: {灯|とも}らない\n- Polite: {灯|とも}ります\n- Te-form: {灯|とも}って\n- Past: {灯|とも}った\n\nUSAGE:\nAn intransitive verb. The transitive counterpart is {灯|とも}す (to light, to illuminate). {灯|とも}る often appears in literary and poetic contexts, evoking a warm, atmospheric mood.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {灯|あか}りが{灯|とも}る: a light comes on\n- ろうそくが{灯|とも}る: a candle is lit\n- {街灯|がいとう}が{灯|とも}る: streetlights come on\n- {希望|きぼう}の{灯|ひ}が{灯|とも}る: a light of hope is kindled (figurative)",
